              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ANGELFROMHEAVEN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great addition to salads, soups, potatoes, sandwiches, casseroles, and so much more! It is important to use a small size pan for frying along with the small amount of oil. Fun recipe!",
