            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lucylove"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So simple, so easy and soooo delicious. I can't eat gluten and these are the perfect replacement for the canned variety, way less greasy, and so much healthier, too. The thinner you slice the onion, the better the result. Try them over creamy, buttery mashed potatoes. Yum!",
